            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paul Johnson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Kalbi Jim is a fave at my favorite Korean place. This recipe was easy. I did make two modifications. I put a good sear on the short ribs and instead of water I used beef broth - which gave it richer flavor and a bit more depth.",
